<title>BELGIUM: MERCER TO LIST ON EASDAQ - PAPER.</title>
<headline>MERCER TO LIST ON EASDAQ - PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. recycled paper products manufacturer Mercer International Inc will list on European small cap market Easdaq from January 17, Belgian newspaper L'Echo reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue sponsor is Investmentbank Austria, L'Echo said.</p>
<p>Mercer is already listed on the U.S. Nasdaq exchange, upon which Easdaq is modelled.</p>
<p>Mercer will be the fifth listing on Easdaq since the bourse was launched last November.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
